 "arm_change": "the critic alone also sees the episode phase: each TRAINING env's observation carries (ramp, settled, discount) of its own step counter in the three command slots 60-62 (always zero in stance; a class swap on each env instance's _get_obs); the policy's mlp_extractor gets a forward_actor that sets the NORMALISED slots 60-62 to 0.0 (the value the actor always saw) before the policy MLP, so the actor never sees the phase and its first-layer phase columns get no gradient; the critic's first-layer columns 60-62 (value_net.0.weight[:, 60:63]) are set to zero at the load (their Adam moments are already exactly zero), so the critic at the load is the start pair's on every input and learns the phase from there; the training VecNormalize's slots 60-62 are reseeded to mean 0 / var 1 and kept there after every update (a class swap on the SymmetricRunningMeanStd instance, pickling as the stock RunningMeanStd); MirrorKLPPO's observation mirror map maps slots 60-62 to themselves with sign +1; the policy probe feeds each bank state's phase to the critic (all ten bank states are settled, k >= 200); the evaluation env, the probe's bank env and every other setting are the run's own",
